WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.120
Hank: Good morning John, I just got back home
to Missoula! Ooh, from tour. And I thought

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:09.430
it might be interesting to share with you
one full day in the life of the tour, what

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:12.580
it's like on the road. So here we go:

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:19.320
Step 1 - Wake up stupid early in the morning.
Step 2 - Put on your awesome new belt buckle.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:23.850
Step 3 - Everything, no matter how disgusting,
goes in one bag.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:29.380
Step 3 - Van Tetris.
Step 6 - Go exploring.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:35.290
Step 9 - Breakfast.
Step 9.5 - Car breakfast. Keeps going.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:42.000
Steps 10 through 800 is sit in the van. Andrew's
in there somewhere. What? Eyeball! [All singing]

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
She was looking kind of dumb with her finger
and her thumb in the shape of an L on her

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:51.140
forehead.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:57.360
This is the part of the day where we try to
get Ethiopian food, but it's closed. And now

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:02.219
we're in a parking lot and it's a thousand
degrees Kelvin. And now I have to pee!

00:01:02.219 --> 00:01:07.979
Step 3th - Arrive at the venue and comment
on how it's different from other venues you've

00:01:07.979 --> 00:01:08.649
played at.

00:01:08.649 --> 00:01:13.249
So they haven't been like this for the most
part. I mean, I don't want to tell you what

00:01:13.249 --> 00:01:17.349
kind of bathrooms I've been spending time
in, but they're not like this one. You get

00:01:17.349 --> 00:01:18.319
a riser today.

00:01:18.319 --> 00:01:21.920
Rob: Yeah, I get to be really really high
up.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.329
Hank: Nice.

00:01:23.329 --> 00:01:25.450
[Rob plays guitar]

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:31.759
Hank: That was the part where Rob Scallon
plays me a personal concert. So I missed the

00:01:31.759 --> 00:01:36.299
step where we load everything into the venue.
I feel bad about that. I don't know where

00:01:36.299 --> 00:01:40.020
I was. I had to do something? I was on a phone
call.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.299
Step 32 - Set up the merch stand.

00:01:43.299 --> 00:01:45.569
Step 35 - Gimme my VIP bracelet!

00:01:45.569 --> 00:01:49.819
Sam: These aren't just made out of paper,
these are made out of solid gold and platinum.

00:01:49.819 --> 00:01:51.469
Hank: What are the sparkles made of?

00:01:51.469 --> 00:01:52.189
Sam: Splatinum!

00:01:52.189 --> 00:01:57.069
Hank: This is the green room, which is purple
here. You can tell this is a nice green room

00:01:57.069 --> 00:02:00.179
because I have not seen a single piece of
pornographic graffiti.

00:02:00.179 --> 00:02:01.799
Step 92 - Tune your guitar.

00:02:01.799 --> 00:02:03.450
What are we doing now?!

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:04.619
Craig: INTERNET!

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:10.489
Joe: [Singing] 'Baby baby when you touch me
like this'

00:02:10.489 --> 00:02:17.489
Hank: [Singing] -about what lies beneath these
clothes just by looking at me-

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.849
Step negative 8 - Dinner.

00:02:19.849 --> 00:02:22.519
Step 801 - Meet friends.

00:02:22.519 --> 00:02:23.849
Michael: Hi!

00:02:23.849 --> 00:02:26.400
Step 4 - Make your set lists.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.700
Step 5 - Paul takes off his shirt.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.359
Step 25 - Pee. A bunch of different times
before we go onstage.

00:02:32.359 --> 00:02:35.819
This is the part I hate the most is the waiting
to go onstage.

00:02:35.819 --> 00:02:39.530
Driftless Pony Club just finished. I can tell
because of how wet Sam is.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:41.469
Huddle up. Huddle up.

00:02:41.469 --> 00:02:42.870
Joe: Alright, goop on three. Goop.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:46.069
Part 83 - Do your hair in your camera before
you go onstage.

00:02:46.069 --> 00:02:47.870
Part 84 - Go onstage.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:54.870
I forgot the run of show. I don't go onstage
yet. [music and cheers]

00:02:56.459 --> 00:02:59.140
Part 6,082 - Finish the show.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:04.129
Ah! Oh, that's nice! Ah! Whoo!

00:03:04.129 --> 00:03:08.390
Part 8 million - I'm going out to sign and
take pictures with people.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:13.680
Step 94 - Get to the hotel, realize that you're
starving, and try and figure out a place to

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:14.140
eat.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.269
Step 98 - Goof around.

00:03:16.269 --> 00:03:17.900
Step 93 - Second dinners!

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:23.749
We just taught Andrew how to take off his
VIP wrist bracelet, during which process he

00:03:23.749 --> 00:03:27.269
karate chopped his beer onto me.

00:03:27.269 --> 00:03:32.950
Step 2 - Fall asleep in the van again.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:37.510
Step firty toof - Go to bed and do it all
over again in the morning.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:39.840
John, I'll see you on Tuesday.

